1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,410
A skilled carpenter carefully measures a piece of oak wood
with his ruler.

2
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:08,779
He marks the cutting lines with precision using a sharp
pencil.

3
00:00:08,779 --> 00:00:13,960
The man picks up his handsaw and begins cutting the wood
with steady strokes.

4
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:18,820
He smooths the edges with sandpaper creating a perfect
wooden plank.

5
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:24,100
Finally he steps back to admire his crafted work with a
satisfied smile.
